scenario every satellite disappears between two epochs
describe From an open sky to nothing in one second. Physically that is a lid
describe closing over the antenna; it is also what a transmitter capturing the
describe receiver looks like from the outside. Either way it is not a normal
describe reading, and the second step is the impossible one: more satellites
describe used than are in view.

at 0
  fix 3d
  pos 5000000 10000000
  alt 42000
  acc 3500
  sats 11 14
  hdop 90
  jam none
  spoof none
  expect trust trusted
  expect no-reason constellation-anomaly

at 1000
  fix 3d
  pos 5000010 10000010
  alt 42000
  acc 3500
  sats 9 0
  hdop 95
  jam none
  spoof none
  expect reason constellation-anomaly

at 2000
  fix none
  sats 0 0
  expect validity nofix
  expect reason fix-lost
  expect trust degraded
